{"id":"e615e30a04aee2ed","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-permanent.md","title":"Permanent Polynomial","display":"df-permanent — Permanent Polynomial","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-permanent","aliases":["28-df-permanent"],"display":"df-permanent — Permanent Polynomial","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §17.3.1 and §16.1.4","source_printed_pages":"347,323","source_pdf_pages":"373,349","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-permanent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-permanent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-permanent — Permanent Polynomial"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §17.3.1 and §16.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"347,323"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"373,349"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为交换含幺环，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(a_{ij})\\in R^{n\\times n}\">\\(A=(a_{ij})\\in R^{n\\times n}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 的排列集；空乘积为1，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(S_0=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{perm}_n(A)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\prod_{i=1}^n a_{i,\\sigma(i)},\\qquad\\operatorname{perm}_0(\\varnothing)\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{perm}_n(A)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\prod_{i=1}^n a_{i,\\sigma(i)},\\qquad\\operatorname{perm}_0(\\varnothing)\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限求和与乘积定义唯一环元素；没有行列式的排列符号。选定交换含幺环使整数权重、有限域和0/1计数实例共用本地接口。定义不含算法复杂度断言。</p>\n<p>来源：§17.3.1 and §16.1.4；印刷页 347,323；PDF 页 373,349。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第17章的 Permanent Polynomial，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A=(a_{ij})\\in R^{n\\times n}","display":false},{"tex":"S_n","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"S_0=\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{perm}_n(A)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\prod_{i=1}^n a_{i,\\sigma(i)},\\qquad\\operatorname{perm}_0(\\varnothing)\\coloneqq1.","display":true}],"bytes":1429,"backlinks":[{"id":"8c3be7e8c8cc164e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$E\\subseteq[n]\\times[n]$，$G=([n],E)$，$w:E\\to R$，$R$ 为交换含幺环；$\\mathcal{CC},W_w$ 见 [[28-df-cycle-cover]]，$\\operatorname{perm}$ 见 [[28-df-permanent]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-permanent]]、[[28-df-cycle-cover]]、[[28-lem-permanent-cycle-cover]]、[[28-df-parity-p]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}